# Creakwood Safewright {1}{B} 5/5: "This creature enters with three -1/-1 counters on it. At the beginning of your end step, if there is
# an Elf card in your graveyard and this creature has a -1/-1 counter on it, remove a -1/-1 counter from this creature" (CR 614.1c,
# 603.4). Bot1 casts Scarblade Scout, whose mill puts Llanowar Elves in the graveyard, then the Safewright: it enters 2/2 with three
# counters, and each of Bot1's end steps takes one off (3/3, 4/4, then 5/5 with none left). With none left the ability is not put on
# the stack at the fourth end step. Black Lotus (BBB) and Mox Jet pay for both.

